        "name": "QB Adventures: How to become a Qnight",
        "steam_appid": 4192940,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>QB Adventures</i> is a calm yet clever puzzle game about finding the perfect path. Each level is a self-contained board where every step matters: your goal is simple — <strong>walk a route that extinguishes every lit tile</strong> without getting stuck or leaving anything behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a small challenge quickly grows into a satisfying sequence of logic problems. New mechanics appear as you travel through different biomes: timed tiles, directional arrows, shifting patterns, and the ever-present <strong>Trianglets</strong> that change the board in unexpected ways. Every move is a tiny puzzle inside the bigger one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, QB follows the footsteps of <strong>Lord Square</strong> — both metaphorically and quite literally. A light narrative accompanies your journey, giving context without interrupting the flow of the puzzles, and turning each board into a step on the path toward becoming a true <i>Qnight</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>QB Adventures</i> is designed to be easy to pick up and quietly rewarding, offering a blend of calm thinking, clean visuals, and an accessible challenge for anyone who enjoys logical puzzles.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>QB Adventures</i> is a calm yet clever puzzle game about finding the perfect path. Each level is a self-contained board where every step matters: your goal is simple — <strong>walk a route that extinguishes every lit tile</strong> without getting stuck or leaving anything behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a small challenge quickly grows into a satisfying sequence of logic problems. New mechanics appear as you travel through different biomes: timed tiles, directional arrows, shifting patterns, and the ever-present <strong>Trianglets</strong> that change the board in unexpected ways. Every move is a tiny puzzle inside the bigger one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along the way, QB follows the footsteps of <strong>Lord Square</strong> — both metaphorically and quite literally. A light narrative accompanies your journey, giving context without interrupting the flow of the puzzles, and turning each board into a step on the path toward becoming a true <i>Qnight</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>QB Adventures</i> is designed to be easy to pick up and quietly rewarding, offering a blend of calm thinking, clean visuals, and an accessible challenge for anyone who enjoys logical puzzles.</p>",
        "short_description": "A calm yet clever logic puzzle game where you plan routes, extinguish tiles, and outsmart shifting boards across a variety of biomes. Follow QB as they literally and figuratively walk the path of Lord Square, solving clean, satisfying puzzles wrapped in a light narrative charm.",
